---
// Where the Android app stands on Google Play, and a warning about apps with
// similar names. Remove once the store listing is public.
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---
<aside class="post-notice post-notice-dev" aria-label="Android app status">
  <Icon name="flag" size={20} />
  <p><strong>The OpenTodo Android app is not available on Google Play yet.</strong> It is in internal testing, and Google's policy for new developer accounts means it can only be published after a test period: about two weeks, so around mid-November 2026. Many apps on Google Play have names similar to OpenTodo; none of them is this one. Once the app is public, this site will link to its store listing. Until then, install OpenTodo from the browser as described below.</p>
</aside>
